    "updated_at": "2019-08-24T22:57:52Z",
    "body": "I would prefer we default to the behavior as shown here: `a_git_repo/p/p/s/modules/session`\r\nI think that for most people, fish-style paths would be an alternative to path truncation.\r\n\r\nDo you think we could perhaps have `path_style` with these possible options: `length_truncation`, and `fish_style`?\r\n\r\nI understand that this can quickly be difficult to explain to new users. 😅 ",
